WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:01.360
Hello, everybody. My name is Markiplier

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:03.600
and welcome to "A Trip to Yugoslavia".

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:07.980
This is supposedly a horror game made in, like, the VHS era

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.200
and it's supposed to feature, like, "live-action" stuff.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:12.100
Now, I don't know if that means MOVIES,

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:13.780
or if that just means PICTURES,

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:17.080
but it's about going to a place ya shouldn't go...

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:17.940
"WARNING:

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:22.520
"This is a choice based game, in which your decisions will change the outcome of others."

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.520
"The game saves automatically after you make a decision..."

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.260
Oookay!

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:28.440
"This game isn't based on any real conflict in Yugoslavia."

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.440
Alrighty then!

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:32.580
I have no idea how this is gonna go. But it was highly rated,

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.480
and it seemed really interesting, like, taking these things

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:37.480
from a different perspective. There's always, like,

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:40.420
uh...the--the--the--Power Drill Massacre that was

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:44.220
really cool in this, like, old-style of horror stuff. So,

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:46.660
uh, speaking of which, I always meant to finish

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:48.660
Power Drill Massacre, but I wasn't sure...

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:51.320
Oh, it does! Oh, why am I--is that me?

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:53.020
Oh!

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:55.020
Ow, my--ow, my head!

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:55.700
Okay...

00:00:55.860 --> 00:01:01.420
Oh, that's just a preview of everything to come. I thought that was--okay I'm an idiot! Okay, here we go!

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:03.780
I thought that was happening now.

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:05.260
So...

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:07.520
(deeper voice) What are we doing?

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:08.720
(guitar music)

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:10.300
Oh, it's beautiful!

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:13.000
Oh, it's gorgeous!

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:14.780
Oh, cool!

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:17.120
Is this Yugoslavia?

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:18.360
Hello!

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:19.480
How are you?

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:20.980
Ya having a good time?

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.200
Probably not about to, but maybe now; it's pretty nice with the scenery and everything.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:25.800
(music stops)

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:26.600
Uh, oh!

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.280
Who the hell is that?

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:30.520
Why's he in the middle of the road?

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:33.500
Also, why are you in the middle of the road?

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.580
I noticed he had a camer--Whoa!

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:39.840
Okay, hi! Hi friend, how ya doin'? Am I dead? (heartbeats)

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:42.500
Oh, no, I'm just in trouble.

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:43.780
Ow!

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:48.120
What's the—wha—ow...okay, alright, step and my hand and then step on my face.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:49.520
That's really nice of you guys.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:51.820
What a warm welcome to Yugoslavia!

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:52.920
Oh, okay.

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:55.040
Alright, so this is where the choices come into play.

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:57.940
Now, I've never played this before, and I have no idea.

00:01:58.120 --> 00:02:02.020
All I'm gonna do is, I'm gonna apply my wise logic.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:04.620
He's asleep! I should take his gun!

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:07.440
Murder him, then run away!

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:11.120
Although, making any noise would probably be a very bad idea...

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:13.540
OK...quick time events?

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:14.740
Anything?

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:16.220
What do I do?!?!

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:18.620
I don't know...

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:26.200
Okay...alright...you...okay...alright...you...okay...

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:27.580
Are you gonna try to seduce him?

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:28.700
Whaaat...?

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:31.040
Oh, he has a knife. Oh, OK.

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:33.380
Ah! Yeah! That was smart!

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:34.660
Uhhhooohhh!!!

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:39.080
Wait...Was I supposed to do something?

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:40.240
Uh oh.

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:42.080
Is he gonna die?

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:43.840
Wait, what was I supposed to do?!

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:48.360
(Kidnapper speaks garble)

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:50.780
*Nervous grunt*

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:53.560
(gunshot) Uh oh.

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:55.540
I spit at his face, I think.

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:58.000
What? "It's not going to be that easy. Pay attention and you might survive."

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:01.420
But what was I supposed to do! I didn't see any quick-time evenntts!

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:03.100
What happened??

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:06.860
"Rewind the tape using left shift and try again."

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:10.460
Oh, maybe that was important because that was the tutorial,

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:12.860
and that was telling me what happens if I don't do it,

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:14.860
'cause otherwise, I might be an idiot,

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:16.860
and I have no idea what I'm doing...

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:18.860
So, left shift rewinds,

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:20.040
so hopefully....

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.580
Oooohhhh!

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:24.860
Ah, right shift, OK!

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:27.140
Oh, that's cool!

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:28.840
Oh, that's cool.

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:31.560
They really nailed the effects of VHS fast forwarding.

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:32.740
Ok, here we go.

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:33.900
Now...

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:36.600
What--what...up...

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:38.020
Okay, I upped it!

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:39.340
I upped real good!

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:40.840
I got the ups!

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:42.160
I got all the ups!

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:44.820
Also, why did they kill me just because I was trying to escape?

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.640
Why didn't they kill me before then?

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:49.020
Aren't--am I a valuable prisoner or am I not?

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:50.660
Was this something?

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:52.560
I'm paying attention.

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:53.960
I'm focusing!

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:57.800
All of my powers, invested in this moment.

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:00.460
Almost there!

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:02.260
Ughhh....

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:05.660
Gonna get it--Oh, I'm free then...Okay, never mind.

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:08.440
Uh huh...

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:14.180
Ohh, don't act like it was hard to breathe in that thing!

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:16.140
You've got a perfectly good nose.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:17.160
Alright.

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:19.160
Oh, he looks a little young to be a soldier, but--

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:23.220
I'm gonna give him the benefit of the doubt! Oh yeah. That's a nice gun. Woo!

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:24.960
Ooh!

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:28.420
"I'm not a fan of this decision, but getting rid of the guard means one less problem?"

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:31.340
"I should escape while I can, but both of the guards will come after me."

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:34.080
Well, I mean, obviously!

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:37.360
I mean, duh!

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:41.360
You gotta g--Oh, he's just sleeping! (somber music starts) Oh, he's probably not even the one that...

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:42.840
Ohhh that's so--oooh,

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:44.520
That's grim!

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:46.060
Oh, that's really grim.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:47.060
Hehh!

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:47.580
Ah...

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:49.160
Oh, really?

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:51.860
Oh, really?

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.400
Oh, you're not gonna do it?

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:54.420
Oh, you're gonna wimp out.

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:56.280
Oh, you just wasted time!

00:04:56.280 --> 00:05:00.120
Ohh, you're gonna wimp out like a little baby!

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:02.380
Ohh, what a baby.

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:06.820
Ah, man, that's not a choice! You just made a choice for me!

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.640
C'mon, man. You gotta be better--ooh.

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:11.600
(crunch, chase music)

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:13.520
Wha--I did--What! What??!

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:17.400
That's some intense thumping music, but I didn't even know--

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:19.660
Okay, so, the symbols mean certain things,

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:23.780
but I've done goofed, because I didn't know that I was supposed to go to the right.

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:25.040
Well...

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:28.920
Oh, he's pissin'... I, actu--*laugh* I unlocked an achievement!

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:31.140
Running away like a little bitch baby!

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:34.640
As fast as I can, and making as much noise as I can!

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.460
Oh, now I'm just depressed.

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:39.460
And I think my foot hurts from stepping on that stick!

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:40.720
Alright, man.

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:41.800
Ya gotta--

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:44.320
Ya gotta do me proud here; you're making me look bad!

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:45.380
Alright, c'mon.

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:46.100
C'mon.

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:46.860
C'mon.

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:47.560
C'mon!

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:50.680
I might go back and fix everything, but for right now, c'mon.

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:51.960
C'mon, whaddya gonna do?

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.900
You gonna do a quick-time event?

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:54.660
Heh?

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:58.040
You just gonna stand there awkwardly. Okay.

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:02.000
"I could take him out before he notices, but he could use his rifle against me?"

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:06.000
"Maybe I should take his rifle away first, but if he notices..."

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:11.200
Yeahh, I'm thinkin' getting shot in the face by a rifle isn't a good choice.

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:13.860
How 'bout I go with the bashing him...with the butt!

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:15.140
Bash him.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:16.240
Butt bash him!

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:17.800
Pretty much the preview of the--

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:18.900
(laughs) Hey!

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:21.300
Hey, look over here as I smack ya in the face!

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:23.700
Okay, ladadadada...

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:25.320
Okay, let me loot his wallet here,

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:27.420
because that's probably what I came here for.

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:28.920
Oh boy, double gunning!

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:31.220
Yeah. Yup, he's dead alright.

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:32.520
Ok, moving along.

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:33.820
Boy, that guy was ugly,

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:35.900
and that was a long piss.

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:36.400
Alright, (starts laughing)

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:37.700
Off we go then!

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:39.000
I guess that was a good choice.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.000
My camera should be around here somewhere.

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:44.560
"Photos of surrounding areas should be on it and they might come in handy..."

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:46.540
So, you're a journalist?

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:48.540
"If I make it out alive I'll show the world what happened here."

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:50.000
I got kidnapped!

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:51.660
I don't know why!

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:52.760
Oh, am I--

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:53.320
Oh!

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:54.600
"Enter chamber"?

00:06:54.820 --> 00:06:56.280
"Enter chamber"!?

00:06:56.980 --> 00:06:59.540
I don't like the--I don't like the sound of "chamber".

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:01.180
Okay, this ones got an eyeball,

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:01.940
or a boob!

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:03.960
And it's surrounded by mickey mooses.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.800
This one's got a cat, and then a guy!

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:08.940
Lookin' out, real scary-like!

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:10.520
So, I'm thinking there's a guard behind that one!

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:12.220
I'm gonna go with the boob and the rat.

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:12.940
Uh-oh.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:13.720
There's nothing in here.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:15.680
"UWAGA"!

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:17.340
"INWAZA"!

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:19.160
Okay--ah, a window!

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:20.220
Hello?

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:22.140
"A window covered in dust."

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:24.120
Is it a boob or that an eye?

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:25.620
I can never tell.

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:28.060
Okay, there's nothing here. What about this other one?

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:29.840
Oooh, what was that?

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:32.400
Camera! Okay, got it!

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:34.520
Am I good?

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:35.360
Okay.

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:38.940
Well, that doesn't sound good!

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:40.000
Ow!

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:42.000
Ow!?? Am I dying?!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:50.480
Okay...

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.260
"Progress saved"! Yeah!

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:58.820
I think--I don't know--what else we're doing here.

00:07:58.980 --> 00:08:00.340
Oh, now, I'm sad!

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:02.540
Wait, where'd my rifle go?

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:04.060
I have--

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:07.900
A hundred and eleven bullets in one magazine.

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:09.240
Uh...

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:11.480
I don't like where this is going.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:12.220
What---

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:12.760
Huh?

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:13.500
What?

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:17.800
Safety toggle? Oh, that--that's probably important! Yeah, we need that!

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:20.440
Okay, so safety has been "toogled".

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:22.040
"Flip handgun."

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:22.940
Okay.

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:25.940
Oh, this is so weird, the actual maintenance on the handgun.

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:27.060
Okay, "check magazine".

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:29.900
Okay, I'll do that. What happened to your finger?!

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:31.760
When did that happen?

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:33.060
How many "roons" (rounds)?

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:34.980
How many bull-lets?

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:38.260
How many--killy-killy, shooty-shooty, bang-bangers?

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:39.540
Am I--am I good?

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:43.220
Te--"Test the gun"...I don't think that's a good idea.

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:47.000
Well, sounds like it's gonna make a lot of noise and that's probably a wast a bull--

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:51.480
I'm not gonna do that, even though it's the only choice presented in front of me.

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:52.620
Okay, wh--

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:54.060
Why not?!

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:56.200
(laughs) Why not!?

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:02.180
Heh. Oh--(laughs) Oh, that was--that was a good one! That was a good one!

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:05.040
Here. let's try that again with a little more "Ooomph!"

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:07.260
Oh...

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:09.900
Smart...don't shoot your balls off.

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:11.940
Yeah, no one will notice that.

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:13.640
No one will notice that!

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:16.960
You're the stealthiest reporter to ever go to Yugoslavia!

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:18.700
Okay, grassland...

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:21.460
tense in the distance, mansion...

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:24.320
What is over the mansion? Is that a helicopter?

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:25.040
Okay.

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:29.600
So we got. "It's some kind of mansion. The helicopter above it..."

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:31.300
Tense in the distance...

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:34.000
"It's a camp. Can't see very well from here."

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:38.500
So....I'm guessing there's probably a lot of military people over there.

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:40.660
So, I can go in the grassland, or I can go in the forest.

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:46.220
Something tells me the forest is probably gonna be more secluded, and harder to find me in...

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:47.840
Okay.

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:48.860
Forest.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:51.260
"There's no need to go forward. I think I am safe for now..."

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:51.820
Oh.

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:52.560
What!?

00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:54.500
You think you're safe!? Why?

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.500
Why do you think you're safe? You got kidnapped!

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:57.240
Let's see.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:59.140
"The season is taking it's toll."

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:01.700
Oooh-kay...

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:03.300
Oh, bi-nocs.

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:05.240
Oh, good, I found bi-nocs!

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:07.280
Okay, so I should be able to see something now!

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:08.160
(grunts)

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:11.340
If I squeeze my eyes real hard....

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:14.040
"It's empty as well...what's going on? Are they moving out?"

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:16.180
I guess...

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:17.780
How about the mansion?

00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:19.800
Oh! "It's empty. How so?"

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:22.880
How's it empty! I see a dude right there! And a motorcycle!

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:24.880
And a whole bunch of stuff!

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:27.100
How're you gonna tell it's empty!

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:28.580
Okay then...

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:32.000
So, forest. "The forest seems a bit dense around this area."

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:34.200
Good! Great camouflage!

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:37.420
Oh! Hello! Where were you--Where did you come from!

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:38.580
You weren't there before!

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:39.880
Okay then...

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:41.080
They're after me!

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:41.720
Oh, shit!

00:10:41.920 --> 00:10:42.980
They've spotted me!

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:44.500
With THEIR bi-nocs!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:45.180
Oh, God!

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:47.020
Okay, so, forest...

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:49.200
Forest? Okay, in the forest. 
Okay, good.

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:51.220
I made the right choice here.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.020
Obviously. (grunts)

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:54.040
(action music starts)

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:54.900
Hi.

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:56.040
Oh, hell yeah!

00:10:56.640 --> 00:10:57.900
Oh, hell yeah!

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:00.260
(taunting) You can't catch me!

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:01.680
Not even with your bullets!

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:02.940
Oh, geeze, uh, left!

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:03.920
Yeah!!

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:05.620
Oh, ba-BOOM!

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:07.320
I got you good! Well...

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:09.240
They're both still there...Okay, well...

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:11.400
They're--They're both alive and not dead.

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:13.100
(action music continues)

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:15.840
Okay...

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:18.460
Heh! Up!

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:20.220
I got--(laughs) I gotcha...

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:23.680
Oh! Oh, no! Ow! (laughs) Oooh! Ooof! Ow!

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:26.440
That--that--that winded me a little bit! Oooh!

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:26.960
Ow!

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:27.680
Ooh!

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:29.520
I guess he's okay, though, apparently.

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:31.740
Maybe I just got a BB gun and they're just really scared of it.

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:33.760
Okay.

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.780
(action music stops)

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:38.040
(gasps) Oh, shit, dude!

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:39.360
Uh, oh.

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:40.620
(heartbeats)

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:41.780
Down?

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:43.140
Yeah, that's down!

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:44.860
Why are they just standing there! (gunshot)

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:45.940
Huh, bang!

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:49.360
Oh, no! Oh, ew! Oh, ah! Ugh, eee!

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:51.280
I need to lie down for a moment!

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:53.600
I jus--I just need to catch my breath!

00:11:54.220 --> 00:11:54.800
Okay.

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:56.000
Well, I got him.

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:58.920
Too bad they didn't use their guns on me!

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:01.240
That woulda been a shame!

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.080
(sad music plays)

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:02.580
Oh.

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:04.000
Here we are, wherever this--

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.500
Wha-what happened to you?!

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:06.560
Did you get shot?!

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:09.040
They didn't use their guns once! I watched!

00:12:09.340 --> 00:12:09.980
Oh, well.

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:13.540
Hope you're okay...both limping, AND holding your arm.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:18.000
How'd, uh...did they--did they just stream a line of bullets down your right side,

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:20.680
completely, but is was all flesh wounds all across the surface?

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:23.020
Ohhh, and now you're passing out.

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:25.300
What--what an adventure.

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:27.400
He--he's all tuckered out.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.100
"It was too late to run away."

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:32.500
Oooooohhhuuuhhh!

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:35.380
"The entire town was overrun by enemy soldiers."

00:12:35.760 --> 00:12:37.560
OOHHHHH!

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:41.100
"I decide to stay low, behind the enemy lines. Hoping that I could get back home."

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:42.620
(squeak)

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:44.460
"But that's when I knew..."

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:46.400
I was...

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:48.540
"The war has begun..."

00:12:49.020 --> 00:12:50.380
War were declared!

00:12:50.860 --> 00:12:53.640
Five--Oh! "Five months later"! Oh, we're fast-forwarding!

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:55.300
Oh, okay! (laughs)

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:57.940
I've got a ghillie suit, just made completely out of bushes!

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:59.080
They'll never see me!

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:00.140
I've got my pellet gun!

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:01.320
Oh, I'll getcha!

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:03.140
But I'm not gonna hesitate this time!

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:04.440
You're in for it!

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:05.640
I'm comin' for ya!

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:06.600
Yeah!!!

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:09.300
You'll never hear me comin' when I'm yelling!

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:11.220
I'm 'onna murder ya!

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:14.520
Where's the murder! "The guard might not be malicious, maybe I should just knock him out?"

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:15.300
NO!!!

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:17.720
I'm gonna murder him where he stands!

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:19.520
This time, I'm not gonna miss!

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:21.360
Not today! (intelligible)

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:22.780
Arrrghh, stab!!!

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:24.680
With the back of my knife!

00:13:24.680 --> 00:13:26.800
You know, I'm Rurouni Kenshin.

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:28.300
I never kill.

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:31.160
Oh, he's dead. Am I gonna pull out like a,

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:33.380
like a--like a picture of his family or something?

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:35.000
Oh, okay.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.220
Okay. Alright. Well...

00:13:37.360 --> 00:13:39.680
Time to decorate my home some more.

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:42.380
That I've been living in for five months.

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:45.620
They'll never notice that one of their soldiers have been gone dead.

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:49.200
But if I'd-a just knocked him out, then he might have come after me

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:50.780
So, I think it's probably for the best.

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:52.600
Well, now that I got a rifle back,

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:54.000
because somehow I lost it--oooh, oh!

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:55.100
Uh oh.

00:13:55.420 --> 00:13:58.420
There's something over the horizon. I'm gonna get it.

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:02.380
Ohhhh...I'm readying my fightin' fists!

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:05.540
Oooooh, it's those chambers I remember.

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:06.500
Oh!

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:07.900
Oh, well, that's no good!

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:09.160
Well, that's pretty grim!

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.280
Okey-dokey, then!

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:14.140
Is that a sniper rifle in the back, there?

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:16.420
So one of them might be a "snaper"....

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:19.660
Alright, well...

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:21.980
What am I doin'?

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.840
Was I just so appalled by it?

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:24.560
Let's see...

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:28.500
"A melee weapon could be useful, but I could risk getting spotted."

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:32.420
"I should leave while I still have the chance, but other than this rifle; I don't have any other weapon."

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:33.560
Whaddya know?!?!

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:38.680
Having a rifle seems like a pretty good idea for a weapon...

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:40.740
I'm not a 100% sure about things,

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:43.680
but, you know, as far as a kalashnikov goes...

00:14:43.920 --> 00:14:46.480
Not the worst thing in the world! So...

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:48.880
I'm gonna be stupid and go for the melee weapon.

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:52.060
Let's do iiiiiitttttttttttttttttttttt!!!!!!

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:53.900
C'mon, is there a quick-time event?

00:14:53.900 --> 00:14:55.280
I wanna get this. I wanna do this.

00:14:55.280 --> 00:14:57.200
I wanna get it. I wanna get it.

00:14:57.300 --> 00:14:58.260
I wanna get it.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:01.000
Ehh. eehh. Just gotta watch this terrain.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:03.580
Ooh! Sprained my ankle a little bit over there!

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:05.300
Oh, don't worry about me, though.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:08.780
I've taken, like, dozens of bullets just to my right side, but...

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:12.380
This is the first time my left side got hurt, so I think I'll be okay!

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:13.340
(grunts)

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:17.740
The sneakiest, sneakiest journalist that ever did live...

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:22.340
I haven't managed to get a gun except for this one moment, five months later...

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:24.060
I'm gonna get it. (smacks lips)

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:27.120
I'm gonna flank left, I'm gonna dodge to the right...

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:28.680
I'm gonna do a somersault,

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:30.920
and then spin my ribbon baton, and then hopefully,

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:31.980
you know,

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:35.080
maybe sleep with one of the judges and then get a high score!

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:37.500
But for now, I'm gonna get this!

00:15:37.940 --> 00:15:38.500
Okay...

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:41.020
Yeah, bypass that machine gun on the ground there.

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:42.140
Bypass the sniper rifle.

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:43.400
Go for the shovel!

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:45.020
This is totally worth the shovel!

00:15:45.140 --> 00:15:45.940
Why would they--

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:48.760
Why--why would they just stand there, talking?

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:52.360
We're going to have a conversation away from these dead bodies; the smell is really getting to me!

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:53.500
Alright.

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:57.220
"I should run while they are distracted. I have a lower chance of getting shot while I am running."

00:15:57.220 --> 00:16:00.600
"Sneaking away is risky, but if they don't turn around I should be able to get away safe."

00:16:00.720 --> 00:16:02.080
Okay, so it's either:

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:03.660
guaranteed they look,

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:06.060
or, you know, maybe they don't look.

00:16:06.260 --> 00:16:07.700
Ah, they're probably gonna look!

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:09.080
Eh, they don't have the guns with them...

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:13.620
Run! Run! Run! Run like the--Run like the little baby you are!

00:16:13.760 --> 00:16:14.520
RUN!!!!

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:15.460
Run harder!!

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:16.340
Run!

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:18.440
Uh, ba-bang! Oooh, Ew, ah!

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:19.700
Oh! (coughs) Oh!

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:21.920
Oh! Ohhh! Eeww! Awwwww!!

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:25.380
It didn't work! Oh, God! My spine!

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:26.160
Well..

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:28.600
That sucks! Okay, let's rewind it, here!

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:29.380
Wait, no.

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:30.740
Forward it there...

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:33.720
(fast forwarding voice sounds)

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:34.420
What?

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:37.580
Awww, get away from your schticky keys, I don't need you.

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:43.140
(fast forwarding voice sounds)

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:44.900
Got it!

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:47.300
Alright. Sneak away, ya--ya--ya maroon.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:47.980
Sneak!

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:49.620
Sneak like the wind!

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:50.620
(grunts)

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:52.800
(sings) Na, na, na, na, na, na, na, na, na!

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:53.580
Sneaking!

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:55.360
Na, na, na, na, na, na, na, na, na!

00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:57.120
Really interesting conversation!

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:58.820
Na, na, na, na, na, na, na, na, na!

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:01.740
No need to turn around and look at the dead bodies you buried!

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:02.880
Na, na, na, na, na, na, na, na, na!

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:03.400
Okay, anyway....

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:04.060
So...

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:05.260
Is that annoying yet? (laughs)

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:06.080
Probably.

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:08.440
Oh, look, it's the other side of the chamber!

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:09.500
Alright.

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:10.900
They got a "snaper"...

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:13.200
And they got a really, really

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:14.780
well-trained soldier this time,

00:17:14.780 --> 00:17:16.320
because he actually knows how to

00:17:16.320 --> 00:17:18.240
lift his gun up in the air.

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:20.000
Don't mess with that guy...

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:21.940
Alright, so...

00:17:21.940 --> 00:17:23.960
"Sneaking around and taking them by surprise might be slow,

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:25.440
but maybe it is less of a risk?"

00:17:25.840 --> 00:17:27.180
"Attacking them head on is dangerous,

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:29.900
but this is what--" (laughs) "This is what they deserve!"

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:32.000
Do I deserve to go out, Rambo-style?

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:33.320
The answer is, "Hell yeah, I do!"

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:34.840
(screams)
(action music)

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:36.400
OH, I'M GONNA KILL YOU!

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:38.840
Oh, wow, that's some serious effects over there!

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:40.040
Heh. Down. Heh!

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:41.860
Oh, man, is this actually gonna work?

00:17:41.860 --> 00:17:42.900
Up! Hubba...

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:45.180
Boom! Ohhhhhhhh!!!!

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:46.040
Uh...

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:46.540
Up!

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:47.700
Okay...

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:51.240
So--so--the--the quick-time event is the direction?

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:52.760
That the body is facing?

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:55.180
Oh, these--oh, these guys are gonna--(grunts)

00:17:55.460 --> 00:17:57.540
That guy looked like just a kid.

00:17:57.780 --> 00:17:59.680
Eh! He was just gonna take a nap, you know.

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:02.660
Man, I'm like, one shot, one kill Rambo here.

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:03.460
It is crazy.

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:08.020
Yup, check the windows, make sure they're all dead.

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:08.960
Are they all dead?

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:10.360
They look all dead.

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:13.940
Oh, oh! One more! Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh...! (gunshot)

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:15.420
Bam! Oh...

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:17.560
Oh! I got him!

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:20.400
Yay! (laughs) I murdered everybody!

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:21.960
Hooray!

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:22.800
I'm a--

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:24.700
I--I literally am...I'm behind enemy lines,

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:27.100
and I'm picking off their entire army, one by one.

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:28.640
Uhhhh!!!!

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:30.000
Don't know how, yeah...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:30.500
Splah, eh!

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:32.780
(laughs) The guy didn't want to get it on his friends,

00:18:32.780 --> 00:18:35.420
so, he's like, "Should I shove it in his face...?"

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:38.820
"Eh, alright, on his--on his coat, there! Be a little nice!"

00:18:38.820 --> 00:18:43.160
I bet he did--I bet there's outtakes on where he's like, shoveling right on his friend's face there!

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:46.960
'Cause, obviously this was made by--just like a group of friends who wanted to do a project,

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:48.220
and I really appreciate that!

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.220
I hope any of my stupid jokes

00:18:50.220 --> 00:18:52.180
hasn't come across as me making fun of this...

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:53.480
I think this is really cool!

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:55.480
I really am enjoying myself here because,

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:57.480
it--it reminds me of what

00:18:57.480 --> 00:18:58.780
I used to do. You know?

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.780
I--I didn't have video camera equipment like ths,

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:02.780
but, you know, just going out in the woods and dicking around,

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:04.440
it--it's just like, really cool.

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:06.520
And--and they didn't just make a movie out of it,

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:07.680
which is a lot--what a lot of people do,

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:08.920
they made a game out of it.

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:09.920
Did I have a nap?

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:10.740
What happened?

00:19:10.740 --> 00:19:11.920
Did five months go by?

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:13.380
I missed it. I was rambling!

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:15.000
I'm Rambo-rambling!

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:17.300
I'm "Ramboboling"! (rimshot)

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:21.020
That's what I mean by stupid jokes. That's a bad one; it doesn't make anybody laugh.

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:23.060
You okay there, buddy?

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:24.780
Why'd it go all blue?

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:27.000
Oh! Oh! Sneak mode engaged!

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:28.980
I love it, like, standing up straight....

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:29.980
Sneak!

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.800
Oh, no, no one will see me now!

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:32.980
I'ma sneakin'!

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:34.880
Whoooaaa, shit, dude....

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:36.900
Is someone over there?

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:38.800
Oh, better not stand fully up!

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:40.220
No, notice me....

00:19:40.640 --> 00:19:42.760
Even now, (laughs) even now going down the hill

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:45.020
he..like, all his sneak has just got a slight hunch in his back! Like...

00:19:46.480 --> 00:19:48.080
Lowering my profile...

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.280
No one will see me.

00:19:49.380 --> 00:19:50.020
Oh, shit.

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:52.100
So--so what's so "spoopy" about this building?

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:52.600
Something gonna happen?

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:54.620
Why'd you only bring a knife?!

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:55.680
Oh, hey!

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:58.240
Is he sleeping, too?

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:00.800
Why is everybody asleep, and also, stupid?

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:03.600
Oh, no, that guy might be dead.

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:07.140
That guy might be legitimately dead.

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:07.960
Uh oh.

00:20:07.960 --> 00:20:09.900
Man, I'm making a lot of noise!

00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:10.740
Boy, this--

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:12.640
This guy better be dead, because,

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:15.600
if--if he is not, then he has no excuse and he is about to be dead.

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:17.540
Oh! Oh! He is asleep!

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:20.660
Oh! Lulling his head from side to side!

00:20:20.660 --> 00:20:23.080
I didn't have a single quick-time event there.

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:25.100
And that's when I was expecting it.

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:27.860
Okay...Oh, okay!

00:20:27.860 --> 00:20:28.800
Alright then.

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:32.520
Uh...

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:33.700
Uh, BAM!

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:37.800
(laughs) He's like, "This guy's been through it before!"

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:40.100
This soldier--this soldier knows what's up!

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:41.200
He knows the deal!

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:44.420
He's like, "Ohhhh, caught sleeping again!"

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:46.520
"Oh, you want my hat!"

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:49.080
"Would you like my hat, sir?"

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:50.880
(lsughs)

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:53.880
Oh, geeze.

00:20:54.340 --> 00:20:55.100
Oh, geeze.

00:20:55.100 --> 00:21:00.580
Yeah, e--even now he's like,  "Okay, let me get in a more comfortable position so that I can take a nice nap!"

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:03.820
"Thank you, sir! Everyone else hasn't killed me thus far!"

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:06.760
See..."I should go searching for ammunition and bandages first

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.040
in case I need to defend myself."

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:09.900
"Searching for food and water would make me

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:10.960
stay alive longer on my own."

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:13.100
Yeah, it seems like, more important, so let's do that one!

00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:16.280
'Cause I got, like, 15 guns, there's gotta be some bullets in there!

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:20.520
I took out a outpost! They usually stock those bitches!

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:21.920
Okay, so, maybe...

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:23.460
Meh-beh....

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:25.160
I'm gonna find somethin'...

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:26.840
Meh-beh. Mey-beh...

00:21:27.020 --> 00:21:28.320
But not a 100%.

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:29.460
Okay.

00:21:29.460 --> 00:21:31.460
"Maybe I should risk it and go for it;

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:33.460
I can't lose too much time or I'll get caught."

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:36.780
"Maybe I should look through the windows, just to be sure there's no one there!"

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:39.420
Yeah, I'm gonna do the lin--the--the--the window-looking! You know...

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:41.180
Oh! I got an achievement!

00:21:41.180 --> 00:21:43.180
I don't know what I did, but I got one!

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:44.660
Cool!

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:46.880
Ooooh, dere's food and water in dere.

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:49.360
Dere's some loverly food and water.

00:21:49.840 --> 00:21:52.380
But why would he just be staying in the middle, there?

00:21:52.460 --> 00:21:54.340
Yeah, let me stab this brick real quick!

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:55.680
Okey-dokey, then.

00:21:56.900 --> 00:21:59.220
Maybe I should've just gone for it.

00:21:59.240 --> 00:22:01.080
'Cause it doesn't seem to be anybody in there.

00:22:01.220 --> 00:22:02.980
Also, I love the graffiti.

00:22:04.900 --> 00:22:07.020
Wait! There's a cameraman in here!

00:22:07.020 --> 00:22:07.780
Oh shit!

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:09.260
Oh, nevermind, then.

00:22:09.420 --> 00:22:10.460
He's my friend.

00:22:10.640 --> 00:22:12.000
He's my only friend.

00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:14.920
Okay...

00:22:15.200 --> 00:22:18.120
Man, I really could've just jumped in there!

00:22:20.260 --> 00:22:20.980
Uh huh.

00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:23.280
Well, that took a lot of time.

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:25.960
Eh! "I still have some spare time to look for ammunition."

00:22:25.960 --> 00:22:27.640
Yeah! So what was the point of that!

00:22:28.040 --> 00:22:29.400
Was that okay, then?

00:22:29.800 --> 00:22:31.680
"Since the shovel bought me some time,

00:22:31.680 --> 00:22:34.020
I can use it to find some bandages..." Hoooow?

00:22:34.100 --> 00:22:36.820
I'll take the shovel, I guess?

00:22:36.820 --> 00:22:40.240
I don't know how the shovel bought me any time...

00:22:41.380 --> 00:22:41.880
Uh oh.

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:43.000
Uh oh.

00:22:43.280 --> 00:22:46.720
Am I gonna hit him with the shovel? Please tell me I'm gonna hit him with the shovel.

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:48.600
I really want to hit him with the shovel.

00:22:48.980 --> 00:22:50.540
"He doesn't seem to be going off his patrol pathway;

00:22:50.540 --> 00:22:52.620
Maybe I should just wait until he moves?"

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:53.980
"I don't have much time for waiting,

00:22:53.980 --> 00:22:56.520
I guess I could go for a risk to find a different way in?"

00:22:56.520 --> 00:22:58.240
Yeah, sure, let's do that, because...

00:22:58.240 --> 00:22:58.880
Who knows?

00:22:58.880 --> 00:23:02.780
May--I mean, everybody goes off to have conversations and take pisses around here,

00:23:02.780 --> 00:23:04.060
so it couldn't be too bad.

00:23:04.520 --> 00:23:05.560
Oh, who are you?

00:23:05.560 --> 00:23:07.920
Aren't you the soldier that they just buried the other day?

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:10.480
Or other month? I can't tell time right now.

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:12.780
I don't know about you, but I...

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:15.220
I--I--I probab--I probably notice this.

00:23:15.980 --> 00:23:18.740
Uh...Oh! Oh, no! Oh, nope, dead!

00:23:18.760 --> 00:23:19.340
Dead.

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:20.640
100% dead.

00:23:21.440 --> 00:23:22.120
Uh oh.

00:23:23.240 --> 00:23:24.960
Uh! Uh! Uh!

00:23:25.160 --> 00:23:25.660
Uh!

00:23:26.040 --> 00:23:28.440
Uh! (laughs) Well...well...this is awkward!

00:23:28.440 --> 00:23:30.040
(guard giving demands)

00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:33.160
Man, they must really care about this soldier!

00:23:38.140 --> 00:23:41.100
(fake accent) "Don't try anything stupid!"

00:23:42.200 --> 00:23:43.880
How are you gonna grab it?

00:23:44.280 --> 00:23:45.020
Oh, okay.

00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:49.320
Yeah, okay. Alright, yeah. That...

00:23:49.600 --> 00:23:51.600
Yeah, okay. Yeah, okay. Yeah.

00:23:52.760 --> 00:23:54.040
Okay! Well, that--

00:23:54.460 --> 00:23:56.620
That went better than expected!

00:23:57.300 --> 00:24:00.800
I think about, right about now, they probably, you know, grab their guns up,

00:24:00.800 --> 00:24:02.240
and start shooting at me...

00:24:02.280 --> 00:24:04.200
Right--right about then, that would happen.

00:24:04.200 --> 00:24:05.700
Okay. I'm being overly critical.

00:24:05.900 --> 00:24:08.400
But, I mean, I just--I can't--I can't let that lie...

00:24:08.400 --> 00:24:10.380
That's--that's just right in front of my face, there.

00:24:10.380 --> 00:24:12.800
So I got ammunition, AND I got food and water...

00:24:12.800 --> 00:24:14.800
Oh, and now they're coming for me!

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:16.540
And I got a helmet, somewhere...

00:24:16.540 --> 00:24:17.780
Somewhere, I've got a helmet!

00:24:18.020 --> 00:24:21.160
It's got a li--It's got an opener! I saw one!

00:24:21.800 --> 00:24:23.800
Oh, was that a grenade?

00:24:24.000 --> 00:24:24.620
Ah!

00:24:25.300 --> 00:24:29.600
They spent their entire pyrotechnics budget right then and there. (heartbeats)

00:24:29.860 --> 00:24:30.900
Wha--am I dead?

00:24:30.940 --> 00:24:31.580
Am I okay?

00:24:33.600 --> 00:24:38.560
Why's that guy got a sniper rifle at, literally, ten meters (laughing)...

00:24:38.560 --> 00:24:41.740
...that was--that was not a smart choice on that guy's part.

00:24:41.740 --> 00:24:43.960
Also, I'm not having anymore quick-time events.

00:24:44.280 --> 00:24:45.640
(soldier shouting)

00:24:46.540 --> 00:24:48.500
"Hey!" Ohhhhh!

00:24:48.500 --> 00:24:50.340
It's me! Helmet guy!

00:24:51.380 --> 00:24:53.300
Remember? We're friends!

00:24:53.520 --> 00:24:55.280
Oh, this seems like a trap.

00:24:55.280 --> 00:24:56.540
It seems like a trap.

00:24:58.840 --> 00:24:59.960
D--Don't shoot!

00:25:05.560 --> 00:25:06.760
Ooh, who is that?

00:25:06.960 --> 00:25:08.160
Who are y---ohhh!

00:25:12.100 --> 00:25:13.200
Uh, over?

00:25:15.640 --> 00:25:17.060
Wait, the war??

00:25:19.100 --> 00:25:20.540
Th--The war is over?!

00:25:21.600 --> 00:25:24.720
"He is a part of this war, and in war there will be bloodshed.

00:25:25.480 --> 00:25:27.580
...but maybe he deserves a chance?"

00:25:27.680 --> 00:25:29.200
I'm gonna go with that!

00:25:29.240 --> 00:25:30.440
I like helmet guy!

00:25:30.580 --> 00:25:31.660
Helmet guy is my fav--

00:25:31.720 --> 00:25:33.000
We're friends now!

00:25:33.000 --> 00:25:35.200
Bro! Let's do it, like...

00:25:35.200 --> 00:25:37.480
Arnold Schwarzenegger and that other guy!

00:25:37.480 --> 00:25:37.980
Yeah!

00:25:38.780 --> 00:25:40.940
Okay. Ow. What!

00:25:41.540 --> 00:25:44.900
Wha--Wha--How long--did he--did he betray me?!?

00:25:45.460 --> 00:25:46.820
Did he just punch me?

00:25:47.080 --> 00:25:48.760
Give me a friendly punch?

00:25:49.100 --> 00:25:52.300
Is this--is this your--is this my home now? (laughs)

00:25:52.820 --> 00:25:53.860
Is this my home?

00:25:54.600 --> 00:25:55.980
I have no idea!

00:25:59.200 --> 00:26:01.040
Oh, man, I love this.

00:26:01.700 --> 00:26:04.220
Like I said, I don't want any of my...

00:26:04.260 --> 00:26:06.220
stupid jokes to get in the way of this,

00:26:06.220 --> 00:26:07.640
or you think I don't like this,

00:26:07.640 --> 00:26:09.280
because, no, I love this!

00:26:09.280 --> 00:26:10.820
Because, I love the essence of it,

00:26:10.820 --> 00:26:11.860
I love what it is.

00:26:11.860 --> 00:26:14.720
It's--it's a group of friends trying to make something.

00:26:15.220 --> 00:26:17.060
And, you know, they made it!

00:26:17.060 --> 00:26:18.720
Like, they made it fully; they committed to it.

00:26:18.780 --> 00:26:20.460
You know, it's not GREAT,

00:26:20.460 --> 00:26:23.560
but it's a unique take on it, and it's done in a weird way.

00:26:23.560 --> 00:26:25.080
Oh! And I got bandages!

00:26:25.080 --> 00:26:28.640
Let me just drape it over like a Miss Universe sachet.

00:26:28.640 --> 00:26:29.140
Yeah!

00:26:29.320 --> 00:26:31.240
'Cause I won! I--I ended the war!

00:26:31.240 --> 00:26:34.400
That guy, when he said it was over, the war is all over,

00:26:34.400 --> 00:26:36.220
and everything will be a-okay, so...

00:26:36.460 --> 00:26:37.440
This will do it.

00:26:37.440 --> 00:26:39.300
It's Left 4 Dead-style, you just kind of like...

00:26:39.480 --> 00:26:43.620
Swirl it around your body in a few locations and your HP goes up to maximum.

00:26:43.620 --> 00:26:45.200
Or a little bit below maximum.

00:26:45.820 --> 00:26:46.320
Uh oh.

00:26:47.200 --> 00:26:47.840
Oh, no.

00:26:48.080 --> 00:26:51.680
Oh, this injury is too grievous for a sachet. (laughs)

00:26:52.240 --> 00:26:54.560
A sachet--a sachet to fix. (laughs)

00:26:55.000 --> 00:26:57.880
I don't know why that was really funny to me!

00:26:57.880 --> 00:26:59.080
It was just like--

00:26:59.080 --> 00:26:59.960
like, like the--

00:26:59.960 --> 00:27:04.220
like, the serious of the situation and the silliness of his two straps of bandages!

00:27:04.460 --> 00:27:06.060
Yeah!!

00:27:06.460 --> 00:27:06.960
Yes!

00:27:07.300 --> 00:27:08.900
I love that. I love that!

00:27:08.900 --> 00:27:12.720
I'm critical of a few aspects of it, but it's all in good fun.

00:27:12.840 --> 00:27:14.120
I really love that!

00:27:14.200 --> 00:27:16.860
Even though towards the end, it was like--there was less quick-time events,

00:27:16.860 --> 00:27:20.140
but maybe they spent it all in that one rampage in,

00:27:20.380 --> 00:27:21.320
but still, oh!

00:27:21.540 --> 00:27:22.500
That was cool!

00:27:22.600 --> 00:27:26.460
Like, legitimately! I'm not even saying that as like--like, (hesitantly) "It was good effort!"

00:27:26.500 --> 00:27:28.740
No! Legitimately! That was cool!

00:27:28.740 --> 00:27:32.260
It was something I've never done before, or I've never seen before,

00:27:32.280 --> 00:27:34.340
and they tried something new and they made it.

00:27:34.340 --> 00:27:36.040
They honestly went out, and they made it,

00:27:36.040 --> 00:27:37.720
and I don't know how hard it was to make...

00:27:38.000 --> 00:27:40.900
I mean, obviously, you gotta have, like, story boards for all the branching paths,

00:27:40.900 --> 00:27:41.700
and what you want...

00:27:41.700 --> 00:27:43.800
But they did the best with what they had,

00:27:43.800 --> 00:27:45.760
and obviously, these guys are young, and they're trying something.

00:27:46.240 --> 00:27:47.520
And it was till pretty cool!

00:27:47.820 --> 00:27:49.260
Like, legitimately!

00:27:49.260 --> 00:27:50.980
I--I--I don't wanna overstate.

00:27:51.580 --> 00:27:54.940
I'm not criticizing, like, the deeper aspects of it...

00:27:54.940 --> 00:27:57.460
"Ohhhh, the game play was all fubber-nucked!"

00:27:57.460 --> 00:27:59.760
Like, obviously the game was not there,

00:27:59.760 --> 00:28:02.640
But, for what it was at its very deep core...

00:28:02.700 --> 00:28:03.820
was...cool.

00:28:03.820 --> 00:28:04.940
And I like that.

00:28:05.340 --> 00:28:07.940
So, either way, thank you everybody so much for watching!

00:28:08.220 --> 00:28:09.660
Let me know what you thought of this--

00:28:09.660 --> 00:28:12.420
err--let me know what you thought of a "Trip to Yugoslavia"

00:28:12.420 --> 00:28:13.600
down in the comments below.

00:28:13.600 --> 00:28:15.460
I'd love to visit Yugoslavia!

00:28:15.460 --> 00:28:16.880
It sounds like a great place!

00:28:16.880 --> 00:28:18.260
Maybe I will, someday, so...

00:28:18.420 --> 00:28:19.540
Thank you again!

00:28:19.540 --> 00:28:22.820
And as always, I will see you...in the next video.

00:28:23.100 --> 00:28:24.480
Buh-bye!!!!

00:28:24.560 --> 00:28:25.740
Wait a minute! Wait!

00:28:25.740 --> 00:28:26.660
Bring it back! Bring the tape back!

00:28:26.900 --> 00:28:29.080
(rewinding voice sounds)

00:28:29.080 --> 00:28:30.440
Whoa! Wait a minute! Whoa!

00:28:30.440 --> 00:28:33.260
I got the, "All lies" ending?

00:28:33.660 --> 00:28:35.980
"You thought and attempted to kill a sleeping guard."

00:28:36.260 --> 00:28:38.600
"You decided to arm yourself before attacking."

00:28:38.780 --> 00:28:39.620
"No data"?

00:28:39.740 --> 00:28:41.120
What did I miss there?

00:28:41.120 --> 00:28:42.620
And, this is another thing!

00:28:42.620 --> 00:28:43.920
Sort of, bring more about it...

00:28:43.920 --> 00:28:45.580
Is like, it has choices!

00:28:45.700 --> 00:28:47.740
"You chose to take the life of a patrolling guard."

00:28:47.740 --> 00:28:50.980
Why does it say, "Total enemies killed: 0"?

00:28:51.220 --> 00:28:52.820
"You took a risk and obtained a shovel.

00:28:53.020 --> 00:28:55.020
You showed your enemies war."

00:28:55.120 --> 00:28:57.840
Yeah, I--I'm pretty sure I killed a lot!

00:28:57.840 --> 00:29:00.260
"Food and water were chosen over ammo and bandages."

00:29:00.260 --> 00:29:01.860
"Surrendered soldier was spared."

00:29:01.860 --> 00:29:02.600
Oh, that's the end of it.

00:29:02.720 --> 00:29:03.920
Oh, that's weird!

00:29:03.920 --> 00:29:05.420
Oh, that's cool, though!

00:29:05.420 --> 00:29:08.940
So...I wonder how many different endings there were, and,

00:29:08.960 --> 00:29:10.720
why did it say, "All lies"?

00:29:11.420 --> 00:29:14.620
I--I think some of the tracking may have been a little bit off there, but...

00:29:14.620 --> 00:29:15.940
You know, still not too bad.

00:29:15.940 --> 00:29:16.840
I guess we're done here.

00:29:16.980 --> 00:29:19.280
So...see you around. Bye!

